---
title: "Power Monitoring"
code: "ENE-200"
category: "energy-technology"
credits: "4"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/ELE-157"
  - "2026/MDE-10"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisites: ELE 157 and MDE 10 or equivalents."
---

Covers the equipment, connections, and use of monitoring power production necessary for offsite and onsite use. Includes study of computer applications used for monitoring including real time storage and historical storage of data. Lecture 3 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Total 6 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
